- AN EASY QUIZ TO GET STARTED WITH THE TEMPLATING SYNTAX. READY?

1) If greetings is a signal of the component, you can display its value in your template using?

        {{ greetings }}

        {{ greetings() }} ✅

        (( greetings ))

        [[ greetings() ]]



2) If user is a signal of a component App and contains { name: 'Cyril' }, how can you display 'Cyril'?

        {{ name() }}

        {{ user().name() }}

        {{ user().name }} ✅

        {{ App.user().name }}



